{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:54:37.895Z","ordinal":9794,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c4-a1d3-7222-ae8d-09a20b231d0d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbd9c6eec87d08e4422cb51bee5db","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Yes. I ran another independent review after rewriting it.\n\nResult: approved with no blocking issues. The reviewer confirmed preservation of:\n\n- Pre-push trust and all three choices.\n- Trust/revoke and checkpoint egress behavior.\n- All Claude and Gemini hooks.\n- Removal limited to global activation flags and the ask-once wizard.\n\nIt suggested two minor improvements—explicitly enumerate Claude’s eight hooks and require removal of stale `enable --global` guidance—which I added to the spec."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1787608476468,"completed_at_ms":1787608477895}}
