{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:55:49.877Z","ordinal":9839,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbde359d487d0a8ec3ca57f890fff","status":"completed","call_id":"call_SMLtT13osusfpy2cZq4COtKu","name":"exec","input":"const cmds = [\n  \"entire explain --checkpoint 01M0TPDDEDFB3YH22Y1Q7BYMBD --json --no-pager\",\n  \"entire explain --checkpoint 01M0TMAK37EEM2MHT8XMYGK0AF --json --no-pager\",\n  \"entire explain --checkpoint 01M08T1GNCGPYG9T71HPB70R9S --json --no-pager\"\n];\nconst rs = await Promise.all(cmds.map(cmd => tools.exec_command({cmd, workdir:\"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier\", yield_time_ms:30000, max_output_tokens:12000})));\nrs.forEach((r,i)=>{ text(`CHECKPOINT ${i+1}\\n${r.output}`); });\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787608543.703259}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T21:55:49.986Z","ordinal":9840,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-2ea130fa-ffb8-460b-90e9-5024011a634a","process_id":"63498","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","entire explain --checkpoint 01M0TPDDEDFB3YH22Y1Q7BYMBD --json --no-pager"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"entire explain --checkpoint 01M0TPDDEDFB3YH22Y1Q7BYMBD --json --no-pager"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","stdout":"Usage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n\nControl Plane:\n  api                        Make an authenticated request to an Entire API and print the response\n  grant                      Manage Entire access grants and org membership\n  org                        Manage Entire organizations\n  project                    Manage Entire projects\n  repo                       Manage Entire repositories\n\nExperimental commands:\n  blame                      Show which lines came from Entire checkpoints\n  experts                    Rank agent provenance for code scopes\n  import                     Import pre-existing agent history into Entire (experimental)\n  investigate                Run a multi-agent investigation against the current branch\n  review                     Run a multi-agent review against a branch\n  runner                     Set up and tune trail runners for this repository\n  tokens                     Analyze token usage across sessions and checkpoints\n  why                        Show why a line exists\n\nAdditional Commands:\n  agent-help                 Machine-readable usage for coding agents (always matches the installed CLI)\n  help                       Help about any command\n  labs                       Explore experimental Entire workflows\n  version                    Show build information\n\nFlags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n\nError: Invalid usage: unknown command \"explain\" for \"entire\"\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"Usage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n\nControl Plane:\n  api                        Make an authenticated request to an Entire API and print the response\n  grant                      Manage Entire access grants and org membership\n  org                        Manage Entire organizations\n  project                    Manage Entire projects\n  repo                       Manage Entire repositories\n\nExperimental commands:\n  blame                      Show which lines came from Entire checkpoints\n  experts                    Rank agent provenance for code scopes\n  import                     Import pre-existing agent history into Entire (experimental)\n  investigate                Run a multi-agent investigation against the current branch\n  review                     Run a multi-agent review against a branch\n  runner                     Set up and tune trail runners for this repository\n  tokens                     Analyze token usage across sessions and checkpoints\n  why                        Show why a line exists\n\nAdditional Commands:\n  agent-help                 Machine-readable usage for coding agents (always matches the installed CLI)\n  help 