{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:00:55.963Z","ordinal":9958,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbf0f01e087d08074231bf1e37242","status":"completed","call_id":"call_039lpnxvmiiaX0FhweqUIfKY","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/activation.go`\\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/activation_test.go`\\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/provenance.go`\\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/provenance_test.go`\\n@@\\n - [ ] **Step 4: Write failing route-selection tests**\\n@@\\n Expected: FAIL because activation records are not implemented.\\n+\\n+- [ ] **Step 4: Write failing settings-provenance tests**\\n+\\n+Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\\n+malicious values for OPF commands, checkpoint destination, external agents,\\n+absolute hook path, strategy options, commit linking, and signing. Under\\n+global-only activation none may influence hook execution or egress. Built-in\\n+declarative redaction remains available, and locally activated repositories\\n+retain the existing per-field provenance behavior.\\n+\\n+Implement a positive whitelist:\\n+\\n+```go\\n+type HookSettings struct {\\n+\\tLogLevel            string\\n+\\tPII                 bool\\n+\\tCustomRedactions    []string\\n+\\tExternalizeImages   bool\\n+}\\n+\\n+func LoadHookSettings(ctx context.Context, p RepoPolicy) (HookSettings, error)\\n+```\\n+\\n+Validation starts at the canonical worktree root and `lstat`s each\\n+worktree-relative `.entire/settings*.json` path component. Never derive the\\n+relative path from an already attacker-controlled symlink target.\\n@@\\n-- [ ] **Step 4: Write failing