{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:01:22.080Z","ordinal":9975,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbf2c62e887d09d08366ba763eaa9","status":"completed","call_id":"call_rraYXG5jhyZm3BamAZB7Qexc","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n ```go\\n type GlobalConfig = repopolicy.GlobalConfig\\n type UserSettings = repopolicy.UserSettings\\n \\n-var LoadUserSettings = repopolicy.LoadUserSettings\\n-var ModifyUserSettings = repopolicy.ModifyUserSettings\\n+func LoadUserSettings(ctx context.Context) (*UserSettings, error) {\\n+\\treturn repopolicy.LoadUserSettings(ctx)\\n+}\\n+\\n+func ModifyUserSettings(ctx context.Context, fn func(*UserSettings) error) error {\\n+\\treturn repopolicy.ModifyUserSettings(ctx, fn)\\n+}\\n ```\\n@@\\n The order for `entire enable` is:\\n \\n ```go\\n-p, err := repopolicy.ClassifyRepoPolicy(ctx)\\n+p, err := persistRepoSettingsWithoutRuntimeRouting(...)\\n+p, err = repopolicy.ClassifyRepoPolicy(ctx)\\n p, err = repopolicy.EnsureRuntimeRoute(ctx, p)\\n-err = persistRepoSettings(...)\\n err = repopolicy.SetLocalActivation(ctx, repopolicy.ActivationEnabled)\\n ```\\n \\n-Use the routed policy context for subsequent setup. On partial failure, return an actionable error and leave capture fail-closed. `entire disable` records a per-worktree disabled marker and preserves the route; `--uninstall` removes runtime/route data but retains the disabled tombstone.\\n+The settings write is deliberately rooted at the literal worktree and does not\\n+call `paths.AbsPath`; a project settings file is configuration, never runtime\\n+data. Use the routed policy context for subsequent setup. On partial failure,\\n+return an actionable error and leave capture fail-closed. `entire disable`\\n+records a per-worktree disabled marker and preserves the route; `--uninstall`\\n+removes runtime/route data but retains the disabled tombstone.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787608875.239248}}}
