{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:04:06.820Z","ordinal":10021,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbfd59fbc87d0bbf09df30dfdf8ed","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The plan reviewer found three real gaps before implementation: it caught a route-directory pluralization that would have orphaned existing hidden data, an underspecified settings sanitizer that could have left the symlink/executable-settings finding open, and one missing `global off + trust_all` egress regression. I’m correcting those now and will rerun the whole plan review."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787609045654,"completed_at_ms":1787609046820}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:04:06.823Z","ordinal":10022,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbfd59fbc87d0bbf09df30dfdf8ed","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The plan reviewer found three real gaps before implementation: it caught a route-directory pluralization that would have orphaned existing hidden data, an underspecified settings sanitizer that could have left the symlink/executable-settings finding open, and one missing `global off + trust_all` egress regression. I’m correcting those now and will rerun the whole plan review."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787609036.244717}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:04:21.375Z","ordinal":10023,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbfd6c64887d09ced3ec4ed30ac37","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ynseRAmK1nYH7mQmM4CF5BSn","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/activation.go`: project-settings provenance, activation marker, legacy bootstrap, and disable tombstone.\\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/route.go`: route registry, atomic first-writer-wins selection, and policy context memo.\\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/policy.go`: read-only `ClassifyRepoPolicy` and mutating `EnsureRuntimeRoute` orchestration.\\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/trust.go`: trust identity, egress decision, trust writers, and grant ledger.\\n - Matching focused `_test.go` files beside each responsibility.\\n@@\\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/global.go`: shrink to aliases/facades plus public diagnostics helpers; no independent policy tree.\\n+- `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go`: convert verified provenance into a positive-whitelist `EntireSettings` view for hook-time consumers.\\n@@\\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/provenance.go`\\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/provenance_test.go`\\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go`\\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go`\\n@@\\n Store one record per worktree at:\\n \\n ```text\\n-<git-common-dir>/entire/worktrees/<worktree-key>/activation.json\\n+<git-common-dir>/entire/worktree/<worktree-key>/activation.json\\n ```\\n@@\\n-Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\\n+The leaf package reports verified local-settings provenance; the parent\\n+`settings` package builds the typed sanitized view so it can preserve the exact\\n+existing field shapes. Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\\n malicious values for OPF commands, checkpoint destination, external agents,\\n absolute hook path, strategy options, commit linking, signing, and Vercel.\\n Under global-only activation none may influence hook execution or egress.\\n Built-in declarative redaction remains available, and locally activated\\n repositories retain the existing per-field provenance behavior.\\n \\n-Implement a positive whitelist:\\n+Implement:\\n \\n ```go\\n-type HookSettings struct {\\n-\\tLogLevel          string\\n-\\tPII               bool\\n-\\tCustomRedactions  []string\\n-\\tExternalizeImages bool\\n-}\\n-\\n-func LoadHookSettings(ctx context.Context, p RepoPolicy) (HookSettings, error)\\n+func LoadForRepoPolicy(ctx context.Context, p repopolicy.RepoPolicy) (*EntireSettings, error)\\n ```\\n+\\n+For global-only activation the returned `EntireSettings` copies only\\n+`enabled`, `log_level`, `redaction.pii` (including category pointers and\\n+`custom_patterns`), `redaction.custom_redactions` as its existing\\n+`map[string]string`, and `redaction.externalize_images`. It reconstructs the\\n+redaction object rather than copying scanner/OPF substructures. Malformed\\n+allowed fields fail closed. Local activation preserves the current merged\\n+loader and OPF command provenance rule.\\n+\\n+Add an exhaustive reflection-backed test over every JSON field of\\n+`EntireSettings` and `RedactionSettings`: each field must appear in an explicit\\n+allowed-or-ignored classification table, so adding a field cannot expose it to\\n+global hooks by accident.\\n@@\\n Store:\\n \\n ```text\\n-<git-common-dir>/entire/worktrees/<worktree-key>/route.json\\n+<git-common-dir>/entire/worktree/<worktree-key>/route.json\\n ```\\n@@\\n type RuntimeRoute struct {\\n-\\tVersion int           `json:\\\"version\\\"`\\n-\\tLayout  RuntimeLayout `json:\\\"layout\\\"`\\n+\\tVersion           int           `json:\\\"version\\\"`\\n+\\tLayout            RuntimeLayout `json:\\\"layout\\\"`\\n+\\tCanonicalWorktree string        `json:\\\"canonical_worktree\\\"`\\n+\\tCanonicalGitCommon string       `json:\\\"canonical_git_common\\\"`\\n }\\n@@\\n-The creation critical section covers only read/create/publish. Write and fsync a complete temp file, publish without replacing an existing record, then reread the winner. Never hold this lock around hooks, prompts, Git operations, condensation, or runtime writes.\\n+The creation critical section covers only read/create/publish. Write and fsync\\n+a complete `0600` temp file beneath a user-owned `0700` registry directory,\\n+publish without replacing an existing record, then reread the winner. On every\\n+read verify the full canonical worktree and Git-common identities before using\\n+the short-hash namespace; a mismatch fails closed. Never hold this lock around\\n+hooks, prompts, Git operations, condensation, or runtime writes.\\n@@\\n-go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy ./cmd/entire/cli/paths -run 'Test(EnsureRuntimeRoute|ClassifyRepoPolicy|BootstrapLegacyActivation|LoadHookSettings|Invisible|AbsPath)' -count=1\\n+go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy ./cmd/entire/cli/settings ./cmd/entire/cli/paths -run 'Test(EnsureRuntimeRoute|ClassifyRepoPolicy|BootstrapLegacyActivation|LoadForRepoPolicy|Invisible|AbsPath)' -count=1\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787609036.244717}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:04:21.489Z","ordinal":10024,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-a6ea00cd-2a7b-4ea7-ad74-ef64bfebfc27","changes":{"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -46,2 +46,3 @@\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/global.go`: shrink to aliases/facades plus public diagnostics helpers; no independent policy tree.\n+- `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go`: convert verified provenance into a positive-whitelist `EntireSettings` view for hook-time consumers.\n - `cmd/entire/cli/settings/trust.go`: shrink to compatibility facades or delete once callers use `repopolicy`.\n@@ -190,2 +191,4 @@\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/provenance_test.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go`\n - Create: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/route.go`\n@@ -229,3 +232,3 @@\n ```text\n-<git-common-dir>/entire/worktrees/<worktree-key>/activation.json\n+<git-common-dir>/entire/worktree/<worktree-key>/activation.json\n ```\n@@ -245,3 +248,5 @@\n \n-Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\n+The leaf package reports verified local-settings provenance; the parent\n+`settings` package builds the typed sanitized view so it can preserve the exact\n+existing field shapes. Cover a fresh clone whose tracked or symlink-traversing `.entire` contains\n malicious values for OPF commands, checkpoint destination, external agents,\n@@ -252,14 +257,20 @@\n \n-Implement a positive whitelist:\n+Implement:\n \n ```go\n-type HookSettings struct {\n-\tLogLevel          string\n-\tPII               bool\n-\tCustomRedactions  []string\n-\tExternalizeImages bool\n-}\n+func LoadForRepoPolicy(ctx context.Context, p repopolicy.RepoPolicy) (*EntireSettings, error)\n+```\n+\n+For global-only activation the returned `EntireSettings` copies only\n+`enabled`, `log_level`, `redaction.pii` (including category pointers and\n+`custom_patterns`), `redaction.custom_redactions` as its existing\n+`map[string]string`, and `redaction.externalize_images`. It reconstructs the\n+redaction object rather than copying scanner/OPF substructures. Malformed\n+allowed fields fail closed. Local activation preserves the current merged\n+loader and OPF command provenance rule.\n \n-func LoadHookSettings(ctx context.Context, p RepoPolicy) (HookSettings, error)\n-```\n+Add an exhaustive reflection-backed test over every JSON field of\n+`EntireSettings` and `RedactionSettings`: each field must appear in an explicit\n+allowed-or-ignored classification table, so adding a field cannot expose it to\n+global hooks by accident.\n \n@@ -287,3 +298,3 @@\n ```text\n-<git-common-dir>/entire/worktrees/<worktree-key>/route.json\n+<git-common-dir>/entire/worktree/<worktree-key>/route.json\n ```\n@@ -294,4 +305,6 @@\n type RuntimeRoute struct {\n-\tVersion int           `json:\"version\"`\n-\tLayout  RuntimeLayout `json:\"layout\"`\n+\tVersion           int           `json:\"version\"`\n+\tLayout            RuntimeLayout `json:\"layout\"`\n+\tCanonicalWorktree string        `json:\"canonical_worktree\"`\n+\tCanonicalGitCommon string       `json:\"canonical_git_common\"`\n }\n@@ -304,3 +317,8 @@\n \n-The creation critical section covers only read/create/publish. Write and fsync a complete temp file, publish without replacing an existing record, then reread the winner. Never hold this lock around hooks, prompts, Git operations, condensation, or runtime writes.\n+The creation critical section covers only read/create/publish. Write and fsync\n+a complete `0600` temp file beneath a user-owned `0700` registry directory,\n+publish without replacing an existing record, then reread the winner. On every\n+read verify the full canonical worktree and Git-common identities before using\n+the short-hash namespace; a mismatch fails closed. Never hold this lock around\n+hooks, prompts, Git operations, condensation, or runtime writes.\n \n@@ -315,3 +333,3 @@\n ```bash\n-go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy ./cmd/entire/cli/paths -run 'Test(EnsureRuntimeRoute|ClassifyRepoPolicy|BootstrapLegacyActivation|LoadHookSettings|Invisible|AbsPath)' -count=1\n+go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy ./cmd/entire/cli/settings ./cmd/entire/cli/paths -run 'Test(EnsureRuntimeRoute|ClassifyRepoPolicy|BootstrapLegacyActivation|LoadForRepoPolicy|Invisible|AbsPath)' -count=1\n ```\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787609061422,"completed_at_ms":1787609061489}}
