{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:04:50.944Z","ordinal":10041,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cbffb541087d0a74c3d861316db96","status":"completed","call_id":"call_miI2raqEfsDE5wDGzSo7bulL","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n - [ ] **Step 10: Update the remote and close gates**\\n \\n Before the authorized remote update, run `mise run lint` again. Update `feat/global-trust` with `--force-with-lease`, update the PR/trail body to describe the single coherent feature, then wait for every repository/PR gate to reach terminal state. Compare pre/post risk and security classifications, inspect every failure/degradation, fix valid findings, and repeat until stable. Resolve trail findings only after their implementation and regression tests are present remotely.\\n+\\n+## Finding closure checklist\\n+\\n+Before resolving any trail finding, verify its named regression is present and\\n+passing:\\n+\\n+| Finding | Required regression |\\n+| --- | --- |\\n+| `01M0TSFS8WSCD7CNSV5XJ4Q983` migration gate blocks behind prompt/condensation | `TestPrePushTrust_*` plus concurrent route selection prove prompts/condensation run outside route locks |\\n+| `01M0TSFQ9D1EH7M7VCZ43FYVC6` gate failure aborts host operations | `TestHookPolicyFailureSkipsEntireWithoutFailingHostOperation` covers agent, commit, and branch push; local OPF failure still aborts |\\n+| `01M0TSEWA8GW6BMQEM98Y5AYMS` committed settings grant egress | `TestEgressDecision_CommittedProjectSettingsNeverGrantConsent` |\\n+| `01M0TSE2YQG4NHX4HQPK7P7FW6` symlinked `.entire` unlocks executable settings | provenance plus every hook-settings consumer test rejects symlink traversal and ignores executable/outbound fields |\\n+| `01M0TSDJQKTMR26TPV0Z1N7YG8` accessible prompt grants/panics | `TestPrePushTrust_AccessibleModeNeverImplicitlyGrantsOrPanics` |\\n+| `01M0TSGCWR0EVVQWK526A4BTEZ` expired try-lock context | barrier-controlled `TestEnsureRuntimeRoute_ConcurrentWritersUseOneCompleteWinner` plus canceled-waiter coverage |\\n+| `01M0TSEY7XNH32BR7ZXEGEMABS` revoke misses stale identity | both origin→path→origin and path→origin→path grant-ledger/revoke tests |\\n+| `01M0TSGEJB4B513AV3TS310RN0` disabled tier conflicts with `trust_all` | `TestEgressDecision_GlobalOffDeniesEvenWhenTrustAllIsTrue` |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787609080.727471}}}
