{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:08:35.384Z","ordinal":10109,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cc0d757ac87d0bd1ca3e1cf5deca3","status":"completed","call_id":"call_UYJX5Ney56QxYWJgsA1I9Q4j","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n-git add cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy cmd/entire/cli/paths\\n+git add cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go cmd/entire/cli/paths\\n@@\\n-The settings write is deliberately rooted at the literal worktree and does not\\n+The settings write is deliberately rooted at the literal worktree and does not\\n call `paths.AbsPath`; a project settings file is configuration, never runtime\\n data. Use the routed policy context for subsequent setup. On partial failure,\\n return an actionable error and leave capture fail-closed. `entire disable`\\n records a per-worktree disabled marker and preserves the route; `--uninstall`\\n-removes runtime/route data but retains the disabled tombstone.\\n+removes only the current worktree's runtime/route data but retains the disabled\\n+tombstone.\\n+\\n+Before changing uninstall, add linked-worktree tests with one active sibling.\\n+Session-state deletion and shadow-branch deletion must be filtered to the\\n+current worktree key; the sibling's state, runtime registry, route, activation,\\n+and shadow branches survive. Repository-scope agent hooks and `.entire` cleanup\\n+target only the current worktree. Shared Git hooks are removed only when no\\n+other worktree in the clone remains locally or globally active. User-level\\n+Claude/Gemini hooks are infrastructure and are never removed by repository\\n+disable/uninstall.\\n@@\\n-User-hook reconciliation runs only from installer/update integration\\n+User-hook reconciliation runs only from installer/update integration\\n (`curl-bash-post-install`), `entire enable`, `entire agent add`, and confirmed\\n doctor repair. `entire agent remove` removes that agent's user-scope Entire\\n entries; repository disable/uninstall does not remove shared user-level\\n infrastructure. Reconciliation does not run inside hooks or read-only commands.\\n Installation errors warn without changing global activation policy.\\n+\\n+Target only agents positively detected as installed or whose existing\\n+user-scope configuration already contains an Entire entry; never create an\\n+absent agent's config merely because its implementation is registered. Wrap\\n+each user config's read-modify-write in `flock.AcquireContext` with a named,\\n+bounded foreground timeout and keep the atomic lossless writer inside that\\n+lock. Add a concurrent-writer test proving unrelated user edits survive.\\n+\\n+Add recursion suppression at the reconciliation coordinator: reject hook\\n+contexts (`currentHookAgentName`/the hook command path) and propagate a private\\n+`ENTIRE_INTERNAL_USER_HOOK_RECONCILING=1` sentinel to child Entire processes.\\n+Tests must prove a hook invocation and a child invocation make no config writes,\\n+while the four authorized foreground paths do.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787609292.73921}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:08:35.512Z","ordinal":10110,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-d3287ad3-c34a-43cd-8933-7a1597fd12e9","changes":{"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -379,3 +379,3 @@\n ```bash\n-git add cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy cmd/entire/cli/paths\n+git add cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings.go cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go cmd/entire/cli/paths\n git commit -m \"refactor(global): make activation and runtime routing sticky\"\n@@ -461,3 +461,13 @@\n records a per-worktree disabled marker and preserves the route; `--uninstall`\n-removes runtime/route data but retains the disabled tombstone.\n+removes only the current worktree's runtime/route data but retains the disabled\n+tombstone.\n+\n+Before changing uninstall, add linked-worktree tests with one active sibling.\n+Session-state deletion and shadow-branch deletion must be filtered to the\n+current worktree key; the sibling's state, runtime registry, route, activation,\n+and shadow branches survive. Repository-scope agent hooks and `.entire` cleanup\n+target only the current worktree. Shared Git hooks are removed only when no\n+other worktree in the clone remains locally or globally active. User-level\n+Claude/Gemini hooks are infrastructure and are never removed by repository\n+disable/uninstall.\n \n@@ -683,2 +693,15 @@\n \n+Target only agents positively detected as installed or whose existing\n+user-scope configuration already contains an Entire entry; never create an\n+absent agent's config merely because its implementation is registered. Wrap\n+each user config's read-modify-write in `flock.AcquireContext` with a named,\n+bounded foreground timeout and keep the atomic lossless writer inside that\n+lock. Add a concurrent-writer test proving unrelated user edits survive.\n+\n+Add recursion suppression at the reconciliation coordinator: reject hook\n+contexts (`currentHookAgentName`/the hook command path) and propagate a private\n+`ENTIRE_INTERNAL_USER_HOOK_RECONCILING=1` sentinel to child Entire processes.\n+Tests must prove a hook invocation and a child invocation make no config writes,\n+while the four authorized foreground paths do.\n+\n - [ ] **Step 6: Run agent tests and duplication check**\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787609315448,"completed_at_ms":1787609315512}}
