{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:08:48.298Z","ordinal":10121,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_068dffc2438c6825016a8cc0ea13ec87d09fee9a70ab9e19e3","status":"completed","call_id":"call_XvpLjkGMEWcyYuEjVkvLxgYB","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents - Peyton’s MacBook Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md\\n@@\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/settings.go`\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/hook_settings_test.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/checkpoints.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/settings/checkpoints_test.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/open.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_backend_test.go`\\n@@\\n - Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/common.go`\\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/unpushed_checkpoints.go`\\n - Test: corresponding existing `_test.go` files for each hook-time consumer\\n@@\\n Foreground commands running without a policy snapshot\\n retain the existing full settings behavior.\\n+\\n+Audit the parallel checkpoint-config loader too. When the context contains a\\n+global-only policy, `settings.LoadCheckpointsConfig` may honor explicit\\n+`ENTIRE_CHECKPOINTS_*` environment overrides but must not read repository\\n+`checkpoints` blocks; it returns nil so `checkpoint.Open`,\\n+`strategy/unpushed_checkpoints.go`, and all push/count paths select the compiled\\n+default backend. Add direct tests at `settings/checkpoints_test.go`,\\n+`checkpoint/open.go`, and the strategy consumer proving a malicious project\\n+backend/mirror cannot be constructed. Local activation and foreground contexts\\n+without a policy retain their existing checkpoint configuration behavior.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787609320.468278}}}
