{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:08:54.512Z","ordinal":10127,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-4b864c05-3966-4a09-8533-e5c29e6b46d3","process_id":"4408","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '675,775p' docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '675,775p' docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md","name":"2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md","path":"docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-24-settings-only-global-tracking-refactor.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"\n- repo-scope installation;\n- user-scope installation;\n- currentness/completeness checks;\n- recognized Entire-entry removal;\n- expected counts for status/doctor.\n\nDo not create one lossy generic JSON schema across agents. Share orchestration, not agent-specific serialization.\n\n- [ ] **Step 4: Preserve no-op Gemini events**\n\nDo not remove `AfterModel`, `BeforeToolSelection`, `BeforeTool`, `AfterTool`, or `Notification`, even though their parser currently returns no lifecycle event. Their installed presence and command behavior are part of the product contract.\n\n- [ ] **Step 5: Reconcile hooks as infrastructure**\n\nUser-hook reconciliation runs only from installer/update integration\n(`curl-bash-post-install`), `entire enable`, `entire agent add`, and confirmed\ndoctor repair. `entire agent remove` removes that agent's user-scope Entire\nentries; repository disable/uninstall does not remove shared user-level\ninfrastructure. Reconciliation does not run inside hooks or read-only commands.\nInstallation errors warn without changing global activation policy.\n\nTarget only agents positively detected as installed or whose existing\nuser-scope configuration already contains an Entire entry; never create an\nabsent agent's config merely because its implementation is registered. Wrap\neach user config's read-modify-write in `flock.AcquireContext` with a named,\nbounded foreground timeout and keep the atomic lossless writer inside that\nlock. Add a concurrent-writer test proving unrelated user edits survive.\n\nAdd recursion suppression at the reconciliation coordinator: reject hook\ncontexts (`currentHookAgentName`/the hook command path) and propagate a private\n`ENTIRE_INTERNAL_USER_HOOK_RECONCILING=1` sentinel to child Entire processes.\nTests must prove a hook invocation and a child invocation make no config writes,\nwhile the four authorized foreground paths do.\n\n- [ ] **Step 6: Run agent tests and duplication check**\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\ngo test ./cmd/entire/cli/agent/claudecode ./cmd/entire/cli/agent/geminicli ./cmd/entire/cli/agent -count=1\nmise run dup\n```\n\nExpected: exact inventory unchanged and repeated install/detect/remove loops eliminated or justified.\n\n- [ ] **Step 7: Run the required pre-commit gate and commit**\n\nRun: `mise run check`\n\nCommit:\n\n```bash\ngit add cmd/entire/cli/agent cmd/entire/cli/agent_group.go cmd/entire/cli/agent_group_test.go cmd/entire/cli/setup.go cmd/entire/cli/setup_global.go\ngit commit -m \"refactor(agents): declare user hook contracts once\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### Task 6: Thread one policy snapshot through hooks and diagnostics\n\n**Files:**\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/root.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/hook_registry.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/hook_registry_test.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/hooks_git_cmd.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/hooks_git_cmd_test.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle_test.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/status.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/status_global_test.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entir