{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:38:52.992Z","ordinal":10446,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a035ed-3440-77c1-81b7-dee3f6690838","author":"/root/task1_spec_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/task1_spec_review\nPayload:\n1. **FAIL** — reviewed `bca00205..a195aaa` (1 commit, exactly 8 required files). `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/... -count=1` passes.\n\n2. Missing/incorrect requirements:\n\n- `RuntimeUnknown` has value `\"\"`, not required `\"unknown\"`: [types.go:18](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/types.go:18).\n- Existing worktree-identity helpers are not reused. The leaf duplicates the six-character SHA-256 key and implements a separate identity parser at [repository.go:18](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/repository.go:18), [repository.go:33](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/repository.go:33), and [repository.go:90](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/repository.go:90), rather than sharing/injecting the established implementations at [paths/worktree.go:24](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/paths/worktree.go:24) and [paths/worktree.go:34](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/paths/worktree.go:34).\n- `TestValidateGlobalConfig_InvalidExclusionsFailClosed` neither calls `t.Parallel()` nor uses process-global state warranting an exception, violating the repository’s mandatory test-parallelization rule: [user_settings_test.go:51](/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/Documents%20-%20Peyton%E2%80%99s%20MacBook%20Pro/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/global-settings-tier/cmd/entire/cli/settings/repopolicy/user_settings_test.go:51).\n\n3. No unrelated-file scope creep or later route/trust/hook implementation is evident. No current observable behavior regression was reproduced; the focused settings suites pass. The duplicated identity implementation creates future divergence risk but is not a demonstrated runtime regression."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787611132.992596}}}
