{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:58:37.377Z","ordinal":10630,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ccc9b6e9c87d08158acf68666a2c0","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The production review found two important issues that must be fixed before Task 2:\n\n- strict decoding rejects unknown fields but currently accepts trailing JSON/junk after the first valid object, so malformed settings could still activate tracking;\n- one origin-normalization error includes the raw remote string, which could leak embedded credentials into debug logs.\n\nI’m fixing both with regression tests. I’m also restoring the detailed `GlobalConfig` field contracts while that type is in scope."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787612315462,"completed_at_ms":1787612317377}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T22:58:37.379Z","ordinal":10631,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8ccc9b6e9c87d08158acf68666a2c0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The production review found two important issues that must be fixed before Task 2:\n\n- strict decoding rejects unknown fields but currently accepts trailing JSON/junk after the first valid object, so malformed settings could still activate tracking;\n- one origin-normalization error includes the raw remote string, which could leak embedded credentials into debug logs.\n\nI’m fixing both with regression tests. I’m also restoring the detailed `GlobalConfig` field contracts while that type is in scope."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787612313.909096}}}
