{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T23:31:38.483Z","ordinal":10889,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a025ce-e754-7631-8467-eaa6035ba0f8","turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cd4584fb887d0b208f6583a32940c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nTask 2 separates three ideas that were previously entangled: user intent (“global is enabled”), repository eligibility (“this worktree may activate”), and runtime placement (“this worktree’s data lives here”). Keeping the policy snapshot immutable prevents one hook invocation from changing interpretation halfway through execution.\n\nThe route is first-writer-wins because both explicit enable and lazy global activity may arrive first; once chosen, the layout remains stable so sessions never split across `.entire/` and the Git common directory.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787614296364,"completed_at_ms":1787614298483}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-24T23:31:38.485Z","ordinal":10890,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_068dffc2438c6825016a8cd4584fb887d0b208f6583a32940c","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nTask 2 separates three ideas that were previously entangled: user intent (“global is enabled”), repository eligibility (“this worktree may activate”), and runtime placement (“this worktree’s data lives here”). Keeping the policy snapshot immutable prevents one hook invocation from changing interpretation halfway through execution.\n\nThe route is first-writer-wins because both explicit enable and lazy global activity may arrive first; once chosen, the layout remains stable so sessions never split across `.entire/` and the Git common directory.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a035c5-5c5e-7ca3-86ab-631a16cc0d4a","create_time":1787614293.995028}}}
